From 6d55d92358e130d4ce85a884f9dc45711ea69e06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ultimatejeeves <ultimatejeeves@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 02:25:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Wasm: block linking through per-instance link slots (tail
 calls)

OP_EXTERNJMP_DYN now emits a return_call_indirect into a second imported table
(the table holding compiled blocks). The target index is read from a link slot
in linear memory whose base comes from an immutable 'linkBase' global import, so
slots can be rewritten at run time and each instance of a module has its own.
---
 include/Jitter_CodeGen_Wasm.h |  1 +
 include/MemoryFunction.h      |  6 ++++++
 include/WasmDefs.h            |  3 +++
 src/Jitter_CodeGen_Wasm.cpp   | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/MemoryFunction.cpp        | 25 ++++++++++++++++++++-----
 src/WasmModuleBuilder.cpp     | 19 +++++++++++++++++--
 6 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

